utoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247030/extras/fe26e7f55372990f7803f0b988f25c3b.poster.avif?t=1784904176\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247030/extras/fe26e7f55372990f7803f0b988f25c3b.webm?t=1784904176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247030/extras/fe26e7f55372990f7803f0b988f25c3b.mp4?t=1784904176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40 magical runes creating millions of spell combinations (102,400,000 to be exact!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creative ways to solve each puzzle - do it your own way!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Semi-open world with 9 distinct areas to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hours of gameplay with endless experimentation and replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich, story driven narrative with branching paths and multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sarcastic, sassy mage who accidentally helps people while being rude about it</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Create unique spells by combining magical runes to solve puzzles your way. Transform objects, manipulate time, and discover the mysteries of a world where everyone has vanished, leaving only 12 people behind. Every puzzle has multiple solutions - if you can imagine it, you can probably do it.", "supported_languages": "English", "reviews": "“The world needs more joy, now more than ever, and Rhell: Warped Worlds &amp; Troubled Times seems to pushing in that direction with its mix of relaxed exploration and puzzles, all presented in gorgeous 2.D fashion.”<br>Game Watcher<br><br>“To me, Rhell seems reminiscent of the 